@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Serve then T
Serve then T, four minutes. Start in the right box. After each serve, move to the T and split step,
ready to volley the return. High lob serves first, then hard, flat ones, as I call them. Switch
boxes halfway.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 4:00
0:00 [go]
6% Aim just left of centre, so it touches the side wall.
18% Split step as it passes you. Ready to volley.
30% Now hard and flat, just above the service line, into the back corner. Back to the T as fast.
50% Switch to the left box. High serves again. Aim just right of centre.
68% Split step. Ready to volley.
80% Now hard and flat again.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
